<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>CognitiveOS</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #FAF6F0;
      --card: #FFFFFF;
      --card-2: #F4EEE4;
      --ink: #2B1B12;
      --ink-soft: #6B5B4E;
      --line: #E4D9C9;
      --accent: #E89A3C;
      --accent-deep: #C77F25;
      --blue: #1B3A6E;
      --good: #4A7C59;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.55;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    a { color: var(--blue); text-decoration: none; }
    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    a.real { background: rgba(74,124,89,0.10); border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--good); padding: 0 2px; border-radius: 2px; }
    a.placeholder { color: var(--ink-soft); border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--line); padding: 0 2px; }

    /* ---- top bar ---- */
    header {
      padding: 14px 24px 10px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #FBF4EA 55%, #F7ECDB 100%);
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; font-weight: 600; }
    header h1 .en { color: var(--blue); }
    header h1 .zh { color: var(--accent-deep); margin-left: 8px; }
    .header-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; }
    .tabs { display: flex; gap: 4px; }
    .tabs button {
      border: 1px solid var(--line); background: #FFF; color: var(--ink-soft);
      padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px;
    }
    .tabs button.active { background: var(--blue); border-color: var(--blue); color: #fff; }
    .lang-switch {
      display: inline-flex; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px;
      overflow: hidden; background: #FFF;
    }
    .lang-switch button {
      border: 0; background: transparent; padding: 5px 14px; cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-soft);
    }
    .lang-switch button.active { background: var(--blue); color: #fff; }
    .status {
      display: flex; gap: 14px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-soft);
      padding: 4px 10px; background: var(--card-2); border-radius: 999px;
    }
    .status .dot { display: inline-block; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--good); margin-right: 5px; vertical-align: middle; }

    /* ---- identity strip ---- */
    .identity {
      padding: 14px 24px 18px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: #FFFCF6;
    }
    .identity .row { display: flex; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-soft); }
    .identity strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; margin-right: 6px; }
    .identity .rules { margin-top: 8px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
    .identity .rules span {
      padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(232,154,60,0.14); color: var(--accent-deep); font-size: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(232,154,60,0.3);
    }

    /* ---- hero positioning strip (first screen) ---- */
    .hero {
      padding: 30px 24px;
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, #FFF8EC 0%, #FBE8CA 55%, #F6D8A8 100%);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .hero .hero-title {
      font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink);
      letter-spacing: 0.5px; line-height: 1.35;
    }
    .hero .hero-sub {
      margin-top: 10px; font-size: 15px; color: #8A5A1E;
    }

    /* ---- pains strip (first screen: 3 pain cards) ---- */
    .pains-strip {
      max-width: 1500px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 18px 24px 0;
    }
    .pains-strip .pains-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      background: var(--card-2);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 14px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 980px) { .pains-strip .pains-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

    /* ---- main grid ---- */
    main.dash {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(380px, 1.05fr) minmax(420px, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 18px 24px 0;
      max-width: 1500px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    @media (max-width: 980px) { main.dash { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

    /* ---- left column: brain ---- */
    .brain-card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 14px 14px 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(43,27,18,0.05);
    }
    .brain-card .title {
      font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1.2px; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent-deep); margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .brain-wrap { position: relative; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; }
    .brain-wrap img.brain { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; }
    .brain-wrap svg.overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
    .leader { fill: none; stroke-width: 1.8; opacity: 0.7; }
    .anchor { opacity: 0.9; }
    .callout text { cursor: pointer; }
    .callout .lbl {
      font: 700 18px/1.2 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC", sans-serif;
      fill: var(--ink); paint-order: stroke; stroke: #fff; stroke-width: 4px;
    }
    .callout:hover .leader { stroke-width: 2.6; opacity: 1; }
    .callout:hover .lbl { fill: var(--accent-deep); }
    .callout.selected .leader { stroke-width: 2.6; opacity: 1; }
    .callout.selected .lbl { fill: var(--accent-deep); }

    /* ---- right column: working memory (left) + tools (right) ---- */
    .right-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; min-width: 0; }
    .panel {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 14px 16px 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(43,27,18,0.05);
    }
    .panel h2 {
      margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1.2px; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent-deep);
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    }
    .panel h2 .count {
      background: var(--card-2); color: var(--ink-soft);
      padding: 1px 8px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none;
    }
    .project-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 6px; }
    .project-list li a {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px;
      padding: 8px 10px;
      background: var(--card-2); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px;
      color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; font-size: 13.5px;
    }
    .project-list li a:hover { background: #F0E4D2; text-decoration: none; }
    .project-list .note { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 12px; }
    .qa-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 5px; }
    .qa-list li a {
      display: block;
      padding: 7px 10px;
      border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
      background: var(--card-2); border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
      color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px;
    }
    .qa-list li a:hover { background: #F0E4D2; }
    .qa-list .q { font-weight: 500; }
    .qa-list .ts { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 11px; margin-left: 6px; }
    .qa-list .ts.placeholder { font-style: italic; }
    .tools { display: grid; gap: 6px; font-family: ui-monospace, "JetBrains Mono", Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13px; }
    .tools span { padding: 5px 10px; background: var(--card-2); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; }
    .tools span .label { color: var(--ink-soft); margin-right: 8px; }

    /* ---- working memory (the heart of the dashboard) ---- */
    .memory-strip {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(43,27,18,0.05);
      margin: 16px 24px 0;
      max-width: 1500px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }
    .memory-strip h2 {
      margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1.2px;
      text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent-deep);
    }
    .memory-strip .empty { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 13px; }
    .memory-strip .body { display: none; }
    .memory-strip .body.shown { display: block; }

    .wm-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .wm-head .brain-name { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--blue); }
    .wm-head .sys-name { font-size: 14px; color: var(--accent-deep); font-weight: 600; }
    .wm-head .close {
      margin-left: auto; background: none; border: 0; cursor: pointer;
      color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1;
    }

    .wm-row { margin: 8px 0 4px; display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: baseline; }
    .wm-row .k { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.8px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent-deep); width: 110px; flex: none; }
    .wm-row .v { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--ink); }

    .memory-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 4px; }
    .memory-list li {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      padding: 6px 12px; background: var(--card-2);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
      font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--ink);
    }
    .memory-list li::before { content: "•"; color: var(--accent-deep); font-weight: 700; }
    .memory-list li a { font-family: ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-left: auto; }

    /* ---- about tab ---- */
    .about-wrap { display: none; padding: 22px 24px 40px; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .about-wrap.shown { display: block; }
    .about-wrap h2 { font-size: 26px; color: var(--blue); margin: 0 0 6px; }
    .about-wrap h2.about-h2 { font-size: 22px; color: var(--ink); margin: 32px 0 8px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .about-wrap .lead { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 18px; }
    .about-wrap p { color: #4A3A2C; margin: 8px 0; }
    .about-wrap ul { color: #4A3A2C; padding-left: 22px; }
    .about-wrap li { margin: 5px 0; }
    .about-wrap .brain-regions {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 10px; margin: 12px 0;
    }
    .about-wrap .brain-regions .region {
      background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 12px 14px;
    }
    .about-wrap .brain-regions .region .name { font-weight: 700; color: var(--blue); }
    .about-wrap .brain-regions .region .role { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-top: 2px; }
    .about-wrap .vs {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; gap: 14px; align-items: center;
      margin: 14px 0;
    }
    .about-wrap .vs .box {
      background: var(--card-2); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 12px 14px; font-size: 13.5px;
    }
    .about-wrap .vs .box .box-title { font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .about-wrap .vs .vs-mid { color: var(--accent-deep); font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; }
    .about-wrap .flow {
      background: var(--card-2); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 12px 14px; font-family: ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13px;
      margin: 8px 0; color: #4A3A2C;
    }
    .about-wrap .future-agents { display: grid; gap: 8px; margin: 10px 0; }
    .about-wrap .future-agents .agent {
      display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: baseline;
      background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 14px;
    }
    .about-wrap .future-agents .agent .n { font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-deep); }
    .about-wrap .series { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 10px 0; display: grid; gap: 6px; counter-reset: series; }
    .about-wrap .series li {
      counter-increment: series;
      background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 9px 14px; font-size: 14px;
    }
    .about-wrap .series li::before {
      content: counter(series);
      display: inline-block; width: 22px; height: 22px; line-height: 22px;
      text-align: center; background: var(--accent); color: #fff; border-radius: 50%;
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; margin-right: 10px;
    }
    /* pains block */
    .pains {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFCF6, #F7ECDB);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 22px 24px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .pains-title { font-size: 20px; color: var(--ink); margin: 0 0 14px; }
    .pains-grid {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .pain-card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
    }
    .pain-emoji { font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .pain-name { font-weight: 700; color: var(--blue); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .pain-body { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 13px; }
    .pains-answer {
      margin-top: 14px; padding: 10px 14px;
      background: rgba(232,154,60,0.12);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
      border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
      color: var(--accent-deep); font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px;
    }

    /* ---- cognitive flow diagram (about tab) ---- */
    .flow-diagram {
      background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .flow-diagram h2 { font-size: 18px; color: var(--blue); margin: 0 0 6px; }
    .flow-diagram p.lede { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 13px; margin: 0 0 16px; }
    .flow-diagram svg.flow-svg { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
    .flow-diagram .step text { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "PingFang SC", sans-serif; }
    .flow-diagram .step-label { font: 700 12px/1.2 -apple-system, sans-serif; fill: #fff; }
    .flow-diagram .step-sub { font: 500 9.5px/1.2 -apple-system, sans-serif; fill: #fff; opacity: 0.9; }
    .flow-diagram .arrow { stroke: var(--ink-soft); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; marker-end: url(#arrowhead); }
    .flow-diagram .arrow-label { font: 500 10px/1.2 -apple-system, sans-serif; fill: var(--ink-soft); }
    .flow-diagram .legend { margin-top: 14px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-soft); }
    .flow-diagram .legend b { color: var(--ink); }
  
    /* ---- lower strip (projects + qa groups + commands) ---- */
    .lower-strip {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(240px, 1fr) minmax(340px, 1.4fr) minmax(220px, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 16px 24px 20px;
      max-width: 1500px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    @media (max-width: 1100px) { .lower-strip { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

    /* right column memory panel */
    .right-col { min-width: 0; }
    .memory-panel { min-height: 380px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .memory-panel .body { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; }
    .memory-panel .close { align-self: flex-end; }

    /* qa groups */
    .qa-panel { max-height: 460px; overflow-y: auto; }
    .qa-group { margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .qa-group:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .qa-group-head {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .qa-agent {
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.4px;
      color: var(--blue); text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 2px 10px; background: rgba(27,58,110,0.08);
      border-radius: 999px;
    }
    .qa-count {
      font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-soft);
      background: var(--card-2); padding: 1px 8px; border-radius: 999px;
    }
    .qa-list li a { cursor: pointer; }

    /* inline QA viewer */
    .qa-viewer {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 18px 22px;
      margin: 0 24px 24px;
      max-width: 1500px;
      margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(43,27,18,0.08);
    }
    .qa-viewer .close {
      float: right; cursor: pointer; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 18px;
      background: none; border: 0; line-height: 1;
    }
    .qa-viewer .qv-q {
      font-weight: 600; color: var(--blue); font-size: 15px;
      padding: 8px 12px; background: rgba(27,58,110,0.06);
      border-radius: 8px; margin: 0 0 12px;
    }
    .qa-viewer .qv-a {
      color: #4A3A2C; font-size: 14px; padding: 4px 2px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .qa-viewer .qv-a h1, .qa-viewer .qv-a h2,
    .qa-viewer .qv-a h3, .qa-viewer .qv-a h4 {
      margin: 14px 0 6px; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.3;
    }
    .qa-viewer .qv-a h1 { font-size: 18px; }
    .qa-viewer .qv-a h2 { font-size: 16px; }
    .qa-viewer .qv-a h3 { font-size: 15px; }
    .qa-viewer .qv-a p { margin: 6px 0; }
    .qa-viewer .qv-a ul, .qa-viewer .qv-a ol { margin: 6px 0; padding-left: 22px; }
    .qa-viewer .qv-a li { margin: 3px 0; }
    .qa-viewer .qv-a code {
      background: var(--card-2); padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 12.5px; font-family: ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace;
      color: var(--blue);
    }
    .qa-viewer .qv-a pre {
      background: var(--card-2); border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 12px; overflow-x: auto;
      margin: 8px 0;
    }
    .qa-viewer .qv-a pre code { background: none; padding: 0; }
    .qa-viewer .qv-a blockquote {
      border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); padding: 4px 12px;
      color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 8px 0; background: var(--card-2);
      border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
    }
    .qa-viewer .qv-meta {
      color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1><span class="en">CognitiveOS</span><span class="zh">认知地图</span></h1>
    <div class="header-right">
      <div class="status"><span class="dot"></span><span data-i18n="statusOnline">operational</span></div>
      <div class="tabs">
        <button id="tab-dash" class="active" onclick="switchTab('dash')" data-i18n="tabDash">Dashboard</button>
        <button id="tab-about" onclick="switchTab('about')" data-i18n="tabAbout">About</button>
      </div>
      <div class="lang-switch">
        <button id="lang-en" class="active" onclick="setLang('en')">EN</button>
        <button id="lang-zh" onclick="setLang('zh')">中文</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="identity">
    <div class="row">
      <span><strong data-i18n="master">Master:</strong><span>{{ master_name }}</span></span>
      <span><strong data-i18n="runtime">Runtime:</strong><span data-i18n="runtimeVal">v0.1 · local-first</span></span>
      <span><strong data-i18n="butlers">Butlers:</strong><span data-i18n="butlersVal">Hermes · Codex · Claude</span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="rules">
      {% for rule in rules %}<span>{{ rule }}</span>{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ============ HERO: what is this / why care (first screen) ============ -->
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-title" data-i18n="heroTitle">AI 是你的管家，CognitiveOS 保管你的认知</div>
    <div class="hero-sub" data-i18n="heroSub">换管家、换电脑、换产品，你的偏好/项目/经验都不丢</div>
  </div>

  <!-- ============ PAINS STRIP: 3 pain cards on the first screen ============ -->
  <section class="pains-strip">
    <div class="pains-grid">
      <div class="pain-card">
        <div class="pain-emoji">😰</div>
        <div class="pain-name" data-i18n="pain1Title">想换个 AI Agent，却不敢换</div>
        <div class="pain-body" data-i18n="pain1Body">换新的 = 全部重来。你被"记忆锁定"在旧 Agent 上了。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pain-card">
        <div class="pain-emoji">🧠</div>
        <div class="pain-name" data-i18n="pain2Title">换台电脑，等于失忆</div>
        <div class="pain-body" data-i18n="pain2Body">新电脑的 Agent 不认识你。换电脑 = 失忆，从头再来。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pain-card">
        <div class="pain-emoji">🔒</div>
        <div class="pain-name" data-i18n="pain3Title">Agent 的记忆是"它的"，不是"你的"</div>
        <div class="pain-body" data-i18n="pain3Body">不用它了，积累就没了——换了管家，管家记得的事不是主人的事。</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ DASHBOARD TAB ============ -->
  <div id="view-dash">
    <main class="dash">
      <section class="brain-card">
        <div class="title" data-i18n="brainTitle">Cognitive Map</div>
        <div class="brain-wrap">
          <img class="brain" src="assets/brain-source.svg" alt="" />
          <svg class="overlay" viewBox="0 0 960 960" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
            {% for r in regions %}
            <g class="callout" data-region="{{ r.key }}">
              {% if r.lx < 200 %}
              <path class="leader" d="M {{ r.ax }} {{ r.ay }} C {{ r.ax - 40 }} {{ r.ay }}, {{ r.lx + 60 }} {{ r.ly }}, {{ r.lx }} {{ r.ly }}" />
              {% elif r.lx > 800 %}
              <path class="leader" d="M {{ r.ax }} {{ r.ay }} C {{ r.ax + 40 }} {{ r.ay }}, {{ r.lx - 60 }} {{ r.ly }}, {{ r.lx }} {{ r.ly }}" />
              {% else %}
              <path class="leader" d="M {{ r.ax }} {{ r.ay }} C {{ r.ax }} {{ r.ay + 50 }}, {{ r.lx }} {{ r.ly - 50 }}, {{ r.lx }} {{ r.ly }}" />
              {% endif %}
              <circle class="anchor" cx="{{ r.ax }}" cy="{{ r.ay }}" r="14" fill="{{ r.color }}" />
              {% if r.lx < 200 %}
              <text class="lbl" text-anchor="end" x="{{ r.lx }}" y="{{ r.ly - 8 }}">{{ r.label_en }}</text>
              <text class="lbl zh-label" text-anchor="end" x="{{ r.lx }}" y="{{ r.ly - 8 }}" display="none">{{ r.label_zh }}</text>
              {% elif r.lx > 800 %}
              <text class="lbl" text-anchor="start" x="{{ r.lx }}" y="{{ r.ly - 8 }}">{{ r.label_en }}</text>
              <text class="lbl zh-label" text-anchor="start" x="{{ r.lx }}" y="{{ r.ly - 8 }}" display="none">{{ r.label_zh }}</text>
              {% else %}
              <text class="lbl" text-anchor="middle" x="{{ r.lx }}" y="{{ r.ly - 8 }}">{{ r.label_en }}</text>
              <text class="lbl zh-label" text-anchor="middle" x="{{ r.lx }}" y="{{ r.ly - 8 }}" display="none">{{ r.label_zh }}</text>
              {% endif %}
            </g>
            {% endfor %}
          </svg>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- right column: working memory (detail of the clicked region) -->
      <section class="right-col">
        <div class="panel memory-panel" id="memory-panel">
          <h2 data-i18n="memoryTitle">Working memory</h2>
          <p class="empty" id="memory-empty" data-i18n="memoryEmpty">Click a region on the cognitive map to load its working memory.</p>
          <div class="body" id="memory-body"></div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <!-- lower strip: projects + per-agent conversations + commands -->
    <div class="lower-strip">
      <div class="panel">
        <h2 data-i18n="projects">Active projects <span class="count">{{ projects | length }}</span></h2>
        {% if projects %}
        <ul class="project-list">
          {% for p in projects %}
          <li><a href="{{ p.path }}">
            <span>{{ p.title }}</span>
            {% if p.note %}<span class="note">{{ p.note }}</span>{% endif %}
          </a></li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        {% else %}
        <p style="color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:13px" data-i18n="projectsEmpty">No projects yet.</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="panel qa-panel">
        <h2 data-i18n="qa">Recent Q&amp;A</h2>
        {% if qa_groups %}
        {% for g in qa_groups %}
        {% set g_idx = loop.index0 %}
        <div class="qa-group">
          <div class="qa-group-head">
            <span class="qa-agent">{{ g.display }}</span>
            <span class="qa-count">{{ g.records | length }}</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="qa-list">
            {% for q in g.records %}
            {% set q_text = q.question | replace('\n', ' ') %}
            {% set q_text2 = q_text | replace('**', '') | replace('`', '') %}
            {% set q_short = q_text2 | truncate(70, True, '…') %}
            <li>
              <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="qa-item" data-idx="{{ loop.index0 }}"
                 data-group="{{ g_idx }}" title="{{ q.timestamp }}"
                 onclick="renderQA({{ g_idx }}, {{ loop.index0 }})">
                <span class="q">{{ q_short }}</span>
                <span class="ts">{{ q.timestamp[:10] }}</span>
              </a>
            </li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
        {% else %}
        <p style="color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:13px" data-i18n="qaEmpty">No conversations yet.</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="panel">
        <h2 data-i18n="tools">Commands</h2>
        <div class="tools">
          <span><span class="label" data-i18n="tool1">brief</span>cogos brief --agent hermes</span>
          <span><span class="label" data-i18n="tool2">fit</span>cogos persona fit --seed N</span>
          <span><span class="label" data-i18n="tool3">verify</span>cogos verify</span>
          <span><span class="label" data-i18n="tool4">export</span>cogos export-user --to file.tar.gz</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- inline QA viewer (renders the clicked conversation) -->
    <div class="qa-viewer" id="qa-viewer" style="display:none">
      <button class="close" onclick="closeQA()" aria-label="close">×</button>
      <div class="qa-viewer-body" id="qa-viewer-body"></div>
    </div>
</div>

  <!-- ============ ABOUT TAB ============ -->
  <div class="about-wrap" id="view-about">
    <!-- ====== Cognitive Flow Diagram (the user's main ask) ====== -->
    <div class="flow-diagram">
      <h2 data-i18n="flowTitle">🧠 大脑各部门如何协作</h2>
      <p class="lede" data-i18n="flowLede">主人发起一次提问时，7 个脑区按下面的顺序协同工作：</p>
      <svg class="flow-svg" viewBox="0 0 1100 360" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Cognitive flow diagram">
        <defs>
          <marker id="arrowhead" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto">
            <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="var(--ink-soft)" />
          </marker>
        </defs>

        <!-- Horizontal flow: thalamus -> hippocampus -> cortex -> prefrontal -> corpus -> reflection -->
        <g class="step">
          <rect x="20"  y="100" width="130" height="60" rx="10" fill="#D97706" />
          <text class="step-label" x="85"  y="128" text-anchor="middle">Thalamus</text>
          <text class="step-sub"   x="85"  y="146" text-anchor="middle" data-i18n="flowStep1Sub">receives input</text>
        </g>
        <g class="step">
          <rect x="195" y="100" width="140" height="60" rx="10" fill="#16A34A" />
          <text class="step-label" x="265" y="128" text-anchor="middle">Hippocampus</text>
          <text class="step-sub"   x="265" y="146" text-anchor="middle" data-i18n="flowStep2Sub">stashes raw</text>
        </g>
        <g class="step">
          <rect x="380" y="100" width="130" height="60" rx="10" fill="#7C3AED" />
          <text class="step-label" x="445" y="128" text-anchor="middle">Cortex</text>
          <text class="step-sub"   x="445" y="146" text-anchor="middle" data-i18n="flowStep3Sub">distills rules</text>
        </g>
        <g class="step">
          <rect x="555" y="100" width="140" height="60" rx="10" fill="#E89A3C" />
          <text class="step-label" x="625" y="128" text-anchor="middle">Prefrontal</text>
          <text class="step-sub"   x="625" y="146" text-anchor="middle" data-i18n="flowStep4Sub">routes to agent</text>
        </g>
        <g class="step">
          <rect x="740" y="100" width="130" height="60" rx="10" fill="#0891B2" />
          <text class="step-label" x="805" y="128" text-anchor="middle">Corpus</text>
          <text class="step-sub"   x="805" y="146" text-anchor="middle" data-i18n="flowStep5Sub">bridges to Agent</text>
        </g>
        <g class="step">
          <rect x="915" y="100" width="165" height="60" rx="10" fill="#DB2777" />
          <text class="step-label" x="997" y="128" text-anchor="middle">Reflection</text>
          <text class="step-sub"   x="997" y="146" text-anchor="middle" data-i18n="flowStep6Sub">reproduces probe</text>
        </g>

        <!-- arrows -->
        <path class="arrow" d="M150 130 L195 130" />
        <path class="arrow" d="M335 130 L380 130" />
        <path class="arrow" d="M510 130 L555 130" />
        <path class="arrow" d="M695 130 L740 130" />
        <path class="arrow" d="M870 130 L915 130" />

        <!-- bottom row: return to cortex + brainstem hosting -->
        <g class="step">
          <rect x="380" y="240" width="500" height="40" rx="20" fill="#64748B" />
          <text class="step-label" x="630" y="265" text-anchor="middle" data-i18n="flowStepBrainstem">Brainstem — keeps the runtime alive, hosts every other region</text>
        </g>
        <!-- loop arrow from reflection back to hippocampus -->
        <path class="arrow" d="M997 160 Q997 220 800 220 Q265 220 265 160" />
        <text class="arrow-label" x="630" y="215" text-anchor="middle" data-i18n="flowLoop">failure → hippocampus for evidence</text>

        <!-- the agent -->
        <g class="step">
          <rect x="730" y="295" width="180" height="50" rx="8" fill="#1B3A6E" />
          <text class="step-label" x="820" y="318" text-anchor="middle" data-i18n="flowStepAgent">External Agent</text>
          <text class="step-sub"   x="820" y="334" text-anchor="middle">Hermes / Codex / Claude</text>
        </g>
        <path class="arrow" d="M805 160 L805 295" />
        <path class="arrow" d="M820 295 L820 160" stroke-dasharray="4 3" />
        <text class="arrow-label" x="855" y="235" data-i18n="flowStepAsk">ask</text>
        <text class="arrow-label" x="785" y="235" data-i18n="flowStepAns">answer</text>
      </svg>

      <div class="legend">
        <div><b data-i18n="flowLegend1Bold">1. 摄入</b> <span data-i18n="flowLegend1Body">主人的输入经丘脑路由到海马体，原样留档。</span></div>
        <div><b data-i18n="flowLegend2Bold">2. 提炼</b> <span data-i18n="flowLegend2Body">皮层把原话变成可复用知识/规则。</span></div>
        <div><b data-i18n="flowLegend3Bold">3. 路由</b> <span data-i18n="flowLegend3Body">前额叶根据任务决定调用哪个 Agent。</span></div>
        <div><b data-i18n="flowLegend4Bold">4. 复刻</b> <span data-i18n="flowLegend4Body">胼胝体把知识+规则传给 Agent，验证它复刻主人的决策模式。</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="about-h2" data-i18n="aboutTitle">如果 AI 是硅基生命，它也需要一个「大脑结构」吗？</h2>
    <p class="lead" data-i18n="aboutLead">主人认知哲学的原始文本（来自 ChatGPT 会话，2026-08-10 整理）</p>

    <p data-i18n="aboutP1">我不是 AI 行业的研究人员，只是一个普通的 AI 使用者。但在每天和 AI 交流、使用 Agent 的过程中，我发现一个很有意思的问题：现在的 AI 越来越聪明，但它好像还不像「人」。</p>

    <h3 data-i18n="aboutH1">🧠 人类的大脑，本身并不是一个简单的大模型</h3>
    <p data-i18n="aboutP2">我们的大脑有不同的区域，它更像一个由很多「专业 Agent」组成的系统：</p>
    <div class="brain-regions">
      <div class="region"><div class="name">🧠 海马体</div><div class="role" data-i18n="aboutHippo">负责记忆形成</div></div>
      <div class="region"><div class="name">🧠 前额叶</div><div class="role" data-i18n="aboutPrefrontal">负责规划、决策</div></div>
      <div class="region"><div class="name">🧠 小脑</div><div class="role" data-i18n="aboutCerebellum">负责动作控制</div></div>
      <div class="region"><div class="name">🧠 语言区域</div><div class="role" data-i18n="aboutLanguage">负责语言处理</div></div>
    </div>

    <h3 data-i18n="aboutH2">而现在很多 AI Agent 是什么？</h3>
    <div class="vs">
      <div class="box">
        <div class="box-title" data-i18n="aboutHuman">真正的人类智能</div>
        <div data-i18n="aboutHumanBody">不只是记住，而是知道什么时候调用什么记忆。大脑自动判断：「这个问题，应该调用哪一部分经验？」</div>
      </div>
      <div class="vs-mid">vs</div>
      <div class="box">
        <div class="box-title" data-i18n="aboutAI">现在的 AI Agent</div>
        <div data-i18n="aboutAIBody">一个大模型 + 一个知识库 + 一个记忆数据库 + 一些工具调用能力。像一个超级聪明的人，把所有东西都塞进一个房间。</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 data-i18n="aboutH3">📊 报表开发者的例子</h3>
    <p data-i18n="aboutP3">遇到 Oracle 问题，我会想到数据库经验；遇到报表需求，我会想到以前设计报表的逻辑；遇到性能问题，我会想到 SQL 优化经验。</p>
    <div class="flow">
      工作经验<br>　↓<br>SQL 优化经验 → Oracle 问题经验 → 报表设计经验<br>　↓<br>遇到报表问题 → 大脑自动激活相关区域
    </div>
    <p data-i18n="aboutP4">但现在很多 AI Agent 的 Memory：所有聊天记录 → 一个 Memory 库 → 全部检索。结果就是：记住了，但是不会分类；有信息，但是不知道什么时候调用；知道过去，但是无法形成经验体系。</p>

    <h3 data-i18n="aboutH4">🚀 下一代 AI，也许不会只是继续扩大参数量</h3>
    <p data-i18n="aboutP5">而是会越来越像人脑：拥有不同功能模块，不同 Agent 之间协作，就像人脑不同区域之间交流。</p>
    <div class="future-agents">
      <div class="agent"><span class="n">👨‍💻 工作 Agent</span><span data-i18n="aboutWork">负责职业技能、项目经验、行业知识</span></div>
      <div class="agent"><span class="n">💡 创意 Agent</span><span data-i18n="aboutCreative">负责灵感、想法、内容创作</span></div>
      <div class="agent"><span class="n">📚 学习 Agent</span><span data-i18n="aboutLearn">负责知识积累和成长路线</span></div>
      <div class="agent"><span class="n">🧠 记忆 Agent</span><span data-i18n="aboutMem">负责整理人生经历，形成长期经验</span></div>
    </div>
    <p data-i18n="aboutP6">也许未来真正强大的 AI，不是一个「知道所有事情」的模型，而是一个「知道自己应该什么时候调用什么能力」的智能系统。</p>

    <h3 data-i18n="aboutH5">📖 系列预告：《如果 AI 想成为数字生命，它还缺少什么？》</h3>
    <ol class="series">
      <li data-i18n="series1">AI 为什么需要「海马体」（长期记忆）</li>
      <li data-i18n="series2">AI 为什么需要「前额叶」（目标规划）</li>
      <li data-i18n="series3">AI 为什么需要「人格系统」（价值判断）</li>
      <li data-i18n="series4">AI 为什么需要「睡眠」（整理经验）</li>
      <li data-i18n="series5">AI 为什么需要「遗忘」（避免记忆污染）</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

